class_name ReminderMessages
extends RefCounted
## The 200 messages of the daily reminders (see Reminders), in English only.
## The Android side picks one at random for each reminder and shows every
## one before any comes round again. A reminder's title says the time of day
## ("Good morning" and so on), so each message suits any time of day. Keep
## them short (tools/test_reminders.gd allows 90 characters), plain ASCII,
## and true to the game.

